msgid "Majestic"
msgstr "Majestic"

msgid "was born out of a simple frustration: customer support tools were either too clunky, too expensive, or didn't integrate well with WordPress. We believed businesses deserved a solution that lived right inside their own dashboard, keeping data secure and workflows seamless."
msgstr "isinilang mula sa simpleng pagkadismaya: ang mga customer support tool ay kadalasang sobrang magulo, sobrang mahal, o hindi maayos na naka-integrate sa WordPress. Naniniwala kaming karapat-dapat ang mga negosyo sa solusyong nasa loob mismo ng kanilang sariling dashboard, ligtas ang data, at maayos ang workflow."

msgid "Today, our goal is to provide the most intuitive, fast, and customizable support portal available on the market. We are continuously listening to user feedback to shape the future of this tool."
msgstr "Ngayon, layunin naming magbigay ng pinaka-intuitive, mabilis, at nako-customize na support portal na available sa merkado. Patuloy kaming nakikinig sa feedback ng mga user upang hubugin ang hinaharap ng tool na ito."

msgid "We recently implemented the Majestic Support plugin for a client’s website to manage ticketing, and it has proven to be an excellent choice. This highly optimized ticket management system offers many features, including an intelligent Smart Reply feature that saves time by suggesting relevant replies. One of the standout features of Majestic Support is its exceptional support and development team, who are always ready to assist. Their commitment to collaboration significantly enhances the user experience. If I had to select a ticket management plugin again, I would choose Majestic Support. The combination of a powerful plugin, and a dedicated support team makes it a top-tier solution for any business needing effective ticket management."
msgstr "Kamakailan naming ipinatupad ang Majestic Support plugin sa website ng isang kliyente upang pamahalaan ang ticketing, at napatunayan itong napakahusay na pagpili. Nag-aalok ang highly optimized ticket management system na ito ng maraming feature, kabilang ang matalinong Smart Reply na nakakatipid ng oras sa pamamagitan ng pagmumungkahi ng kaugnay na mga tugon. Isa sa pinakamalakas na katangian ng Majestic Support ang mahusay nitong support at development team na laging handang tumulong. Ang kanilang pakikipagtulungan ay lubos na nagpapahusay sa karanasan ng user. Kung pipili ulit ako ng ticket management plugin, pipiliin ko ang Majestic Support. Ang kombinasyon ng makapangyarihang plugin at dedikadong support team ay ginagawa itong top-tier na solusyon para sa anumang negosyong nangangailangan ng epektibong ticket management."

