msgid "v1.1.2"
msgstr "v1.1.2"

msgid "Major Update: Security Enhancements, AI Features & Advanced Customization"
msgstr "Major I-update: Security Enhancements, AI Features & Advanced Customization"

msgid "This release focuses on strengthening security while introducing powerful new features and flexibility across the system. We’ve added configuration-based reply ordering in ticket details and significantly enhanced field ordering with new options such as placeholders, descriptions, admin-only controls, default values, and multiple visibility conditions. Product selection and custom status support have also been introduced, along with a token-based option for checking ticket status.\n                                On the usability side, we’ve improved the priority form with a color preview option and updated minimum required fields for better validation. User experience has been enhanced by adding GDPR fields to the registration form and introducing configuration-based user avatars.\n                                A major highlight of this release is the introduction of AI-powered reply suggestions, helping agents respond more efficiently. Additionally, we’ve added SupportCandy import functionality to simplify migration from other systems. Overall, this update delivers better security, smarter automation, and more control for administrators."
msgstr "Nakatuon ang release na ito sa pagpapalakas ng seguridad habang nagdadagdag ng makapangyarihang bagong features at flexibility sa buong system. Nagdagdag kami ng configuration-based ordering ng mga tugon sa detalye ng tiket at malaking pinahusay ang field ordering gamit ang mga bagong opsyon tulad ng placeholders, descriptions, admin-only controls, default values, at multiple visibility conditions. Naidagdag din ang product selection at custom status support, kasama ang token-based option para sa pagsuri ng katayuan ng tiket.\n                                Sa usability side, pinahusay namin ang priority form gamit ang color preview option at na-update ang minimum required fields para sa mas mahusay na validation. Pinahusay din ang user experience sa pamamagitan ng pagdaragdag ng GDPR fields sa registration form at configuration-based user avatars.\n                                Isa sa pinakamahalagang highlight ng release na ito ang AI-powered reply suggestions na tumutulong sa mga ahente na tumugon nang mas mahusay. Dagdag pa rito, idinagdag namin ang SupportCandy import functionality upang gawing mas simple ang migration mula sa ibang systems. Sa kabuuan, naghahatid ang update na ito ng mas mahusay na seguridad, mas matalinong automation, at mas maraming kontrol para sa administrators."

msgid "Released on"
msgstr "Released on"

msgid "v1.1.1"
msgstr "v1.1.1"

msgid "Security Update"
msgstr "Security Update"

msgid "This release fixes security issues reported during the WordPress review process and improves the overall security of the plugin. Users are strongly encouraged to update to the latest version."
msgstr "This release fixes security issues reported during WordPress suriin process at improves ang overall security ng plugin. Users ay strongly encouraged sa i-update sa pinakabago bersyon."

msgid "v1.1.0"
msgstr "v1.1.0"

msgid "Security & Bug Fix Update"
msgstr "Security & Bug Fix Update"

