msgid "Add private notes to a ticket and share crucial information internally with your agents, this private note is not visible to the customer."
msgstr "Magdagdag ng pribadong tala sa tiket at ibahagi ang mahahalagang impormasyon sa loob ng team kasama ang iyong mga ahente; hindi ito makikita ng customer."

msgid "Merge one or more tickets into another if you receive two support requests from the same end user about the same issue."
msgstr "Merge one o more mga tiket into another if ikaw tumanggap two suporta requests from ang same end user about ang same issue."

msgid "The user can search for and choose the topic for which they need help using help topics"
msgstr "user can Maghanap Para sa at choose ang topic Para sa which they need Tulong using Tulong topics"

msgid "Manage abandoned tickets, and set rules for tickets over time, and those tickets will be closed automatically after a certain period."
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang mga inabandunang tiket at magtakda ng mga panuntunan para sa matagal nang tiket upang awtomatikong maisara ang mga ito pagkatapos ng tiyak na panahon."

msgid "Stop wasting time on repetitive inquiries, build your knowledge base, and organize your solutions into categories for users."
msgstr "Itigil ang pag-aaksaya ng oras sa paulit-ulit na tanong; buuin ang iyong base ng kaalaman at ayusin ang mga solusyon sa mga kategorya para sa mga user."

msgid "Define rules or set a specific time interval for making tickets automatically overdue."
msgstr "Define rules o Itakda a specific Oras interval Para sa making mga tiket automatically Overdue."

msgid "Track the amount of time spent on each customer support ticket without losing focus and enhance team productivity."
msgstr "Subaybayan ang amount ng oras spent on each customer suporta tiket without losing focus at enhance team productivity."

msgid "Show the whole history of the ticket, including its status and any action taken in response to it."
msgstr "Ipakita ang whole kasaysayan ng tiket, including its katayuan at any aksyon taken in tugon sa it."

msgid "The simplest approach to effectively manage payments for premium help is through paid support."
msgstr "Ang simplest approach sa effectively pamahalaan payments para sa premium help ay through paid suporta."

msgid "Customers will enter sensitive information on tickets, and this add-on is designed to help you keep that information secure."
msgstr "Mga Customer will enter sensitive impormasyon on mga tiket, at this magdagdag-on ay designed sa help ikaw keep that impormasyon secure."

msgid "Empowers users to provide clear and concise explanations for why customer service tickets are being closed."
msgstr "Empowers users sa provide clear at concise explanations para sa why customer service mga tiket ay being sarado."

msgid "Get AI-powered, context-based suggestions to effortlessly create clear, relevant, and helpful replies."
msgstr "Get AI-powered, context-based suggestions para sa effortlessly Gumawa clear, relevant, at helpful mga tugon."

