msgstr "Tiket aksyon options payagan ikaw sa execute additional mga aksyon on mga tiket."

msgid "Easily export ticket data and performance report data from your majestic support to an Excel spreadsheet with our efficient and user-friendly solution."
msgstr "Madaling i-export ang data ng tiket at performance report data mula sa Majestic Support patungo sa Excel spreadsheet gamit ang aming mahusay at madaling gamitin na solusyon."

